  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$I=\\int_0^\\pi x f(\\sin x) d x=\\int_0^\\pi(\\pi-x) f(\\sin x) d x$\n$=\\pi \\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x) d x-1$\n$2 I=\\pi \\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x) d x$\n$I=\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x) d x=\\pi \\int_0^{\\pi / 2} f(\\sin x) d x$\n$=\\pi \\int_0^{\\pi / 2} f(\\cos x) d x$",
    "image": null
